<title>UK: Goldman sets call warrants on Sony.</title>
<headline>Goldman sets call warrants on Sony.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it has issued five milion American-style call warrants on shares of Sony Corp.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    11,000 YEN		PREMIUM	19.12 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.28 DEM		  GEARING	11.67 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 16.JUN.97-04.DEC.98   PAYDATE	13.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  9,950 YEN (FOREX FIX YEN/DEM 1.5010)</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
